# Configuration lifecycle
# caption: What it settles. Publication, provisioning and activation are three separate states. Keep last-known-good routing during a failed reconciliation. Never delete a number or drop a live call to make a diff disappear.
flowchart TB
    Answers["Immutable survey response"] --> Draft["Versioned compiler draft"]
    Draft --> Checks{"Validation passes?"}
    Checks -->|No| Draft
    Checks -->|Yes| Review["Authorized review"]
    Review --> Published["Immutable published version"]
    Published --> Reconcile["Observe and reconcile provider state"]
    Reconcile --> Ready{"Readiness gates pass?"}
    Ready -->|No| Exception["Resolvable installation exception"]
    Ready -->|Yes| Activate["Activate scoped version"]
  